{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12Destinations8DeliveryV17bufferDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA06BufferD6ReportVGvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"bufferDropReports","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Delivery.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Delivery.swift#L50"}},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports no one has read yet merge, one per destination: a destination’s later drops add"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their record counts to its waiting report and widen its timestamps, so the reports waiting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are at most one per destination, and a late reader still learns every count lost. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence ends once this delivery, every copy of it and every unit of work built on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work"},{"type":"text","text":" are gone, their executions have returned, and every report has been read. Read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so the task holds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports and not the delivery."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","abstract":[{"text":"Where tracked events go: the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/destinations","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The work of delivering a sequence’s batches to destinations, made by "},{"code":"deliver(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports of the batches their full buffers drop."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Delivery","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Delivery"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Delivery"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/bufferDropReports":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped.","type":"text"}],"title":"bufferDropReports","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"type":"topic","title":"AsyncQueue","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","role":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/BufferDropReport":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","kind":"symbol","title":"BufferDropReport","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/bufferdropreport","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BufferDropReport"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Batches a destination’s full buffer dropped before the destination received them."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BufferDropReport"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/work":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The unit of work that delivers: executing it runs the delivery."}],"type":"topic","title":"work","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"work","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent12DeferredTaskC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/work","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}